{"3790990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Asterion", "steam_appid": 3790990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧵 Enter the Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterion is a rogue-like action-adventure set in the mythological Labyrinth of Knossos.<br>Play as <strong>Theseus</strong>, guided by <strong>Ariadne</strong>, and explore a shifting maze full of traps, spirits, and forgotten secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Environmental puzzles inspired by Daedalus’ inventions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧵 Procedurally generated labyrinth floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Enemies from Greek myth: shades, animated statues...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 Mythical artifacts: Ares' Rage, Eolus' Claw, Icarus' Wings...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗣️ Atmospheric storytelling through voice lines and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 A unique visual style inspired by ancient frescoes and modern indie games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯 A Game of Choice and Consequence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just fighting the Minotaur — you’re fighting your fate.<br>Each run uncovers new fragments of the myth, as you piece together your destiny.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧵 Enter the Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterion is a rogue-like action-adventure set in the mythological Labyrinth of Knossos.<br>Play as <strong>Theseus</strong>, guided by <strong>Ariadne</strong>, and explore a shifting maze full of traps, spirits, and forgotten secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Environmental puzzles inspired by Daedalus’ inventions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧵 Procedurally generated labyrinth floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Enemies from Greek myth: shades, animated statues...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 Mythical artifacts: Ares' Rage, Eolus' Claw, Icarus' Wings...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗣️ Atmospheric storytelling through voice lines and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 A unique visual style inspired by ancient frescoes and modern indie games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯 A Game of Choice and Consequence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just fighting the Minotaur — you’re fighting your fate.<br>Each run uncovers new fragments of the myth, as you piece together your destiny.</p>", "short_description": "Asterion is a stylized rogue-like adventure inspired by Greek mythology. Explore the Labyrinth, face the Minotaur, and uncover a haunting story of gods, betrayal, and survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790990/22a09af2fa6a481a0147a2d208de1bbb114a262e/header.jpg?t=1761658012", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790990/a23a63da2fbf47d802837cb88cdad276311e33ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761658012", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790990/a23a63da2fbf47d802837cb88cdad276311e33ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761658012", "website": "https://www.lucarinaudo.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 650 / AMD Radeon HD 7750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong